/config/secrets/prod/prod.decrypt.private.php
# Symfony's recipe commits the dev decrypt key, on the assumption that dev
# secrets are throwaway values. That assumption does not hold here: this
# repository is public (docs/brief.md §13) and the dev vault can end up holding a
# real GitHub App private key. Committing the key next to the ciphertext it
# opens would publish the secret itself.
/config/secrets/dev/dev.decrypt.private.php
